Decision: cap successful read_file results at 200,000 Unicode characters in the shared tool-result finalizer. This prevents a single large text read from consuming the model context while preserving the exact full output in tool-results for paged follow-up reads. The threshold follows the reproduced 707,488-character Beaver log case; token ratios remain provider-dependent, so the invariant is tested in characters. Validation: tool_result_truncate filter 9 passed; tool_files filter 11 passed; cargo fmt --check passed; graphify update . passed.
